1
00:00:00,354 --> 00:00:02,734
(Leonard:)-Hey.
-Laser.

2
00:00:03,649 --> 00:00:05,029
(Howard:)Had a great night last night.

3
00:00:05,192 --> 00:00:10,322
(Howard:)I don't like to kiss and tell,
but somebody made it to eighth base.

4
00:00:12,533 --> 00:00:16,203
(Leonard:)-What the hell is eighth base?
-Seventh base with shirt off.

5
00:00:17,538 --> 00:00:19,958
(Howard:)Well, my shirt.

6
00:00:20,916 --> 00:00:25,006
(Howard:)-How'd things go with Penny?
-Oh, couldn't be better.

7
00:00:28,966 --> 00:00:31,386
(Howard:)Are we taking
our relationship frustrations out...

8
00:00:31,552 --> 00:00:33,222
(Howard:)...on innocent Cylons?

9
00:00:33,387 --> 00:00:35,847
(Leonard:)It's not just Cylons. Superman's next.

10
00:00:38,851 --> 00:00:42,061
I was gonna try to squeeze in
a little more mocking before lunch...

11
00:00:42,229 --> 00:00:45,569
...but I can come back when
you don't have a high-powered weapon.

12
00:00:46,233 --> 00:00:49,693
(Leonard:)How can I go out with a woman
who believes in psychics?

13
00:00:49,862 --> 00:00:53,742
(Howard:)Hey, I once dated a girl who believed
she was abducted by aliens.

14
00:00:53,907 --> 00:00:55,287
(Leonard:)And that didn't bother you?

15
00:00:55,451 --> 00:01:00,021
(Howard:)Au contraire, it meant she was gullible
and open to a little probing.

